  "solution": "Dùng công thức biến đổi tổng thành tích, phương trình đưa về dạng\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"/><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mn>2</mn><mo>sin</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>cos</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>sin</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>cos</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>sin</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>cos</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t<ul><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>).</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>cos</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mo>sin</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>cos</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Nếu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> thì phương trình đưa về dạng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (vô lí).<br>Nếu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, phương trình đưa về dạng\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tCách khác: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>cos</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mo>sin</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>cos</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ul>\n\t\tVậy nghiệm của phương trình đã cho là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>π</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math> (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi></mrow></semantics></math>).\n\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Phát biểu đã cho sai.</li><li>Phát biểu đã cho sai.</li><li>Phát biểu đã cho đúng.</li><li>Phát biểu đã cho đúng.</li></ol>",
